  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can cast spells with total detachment from your body’s condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Still Spell<sup>CRB</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a spell augmented with Still Spell, you do not need to make a concentration check as a result of any physical disruption, including movement (such as riding a horse or being on the deck of a storm-tossed ship), being grappled or pinned, or even being injured while casting.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to cast a spell as a still spell (gaining only the normal benefits of a still spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as still in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> A still spell requires no somatic components.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
